            "lastMessage": "🪔 *Light up new possibilities this Diwali*. ✨\n \nBring every festive idea to life with *HP AI PCs*, powered by *Intel® Core™ 7 processor – That's the power of Intel Inside®*. ✨\n \n🎁 *Unwrap exciting festive offers*:\n \n💰 *Instant Bank Cashback* up to ₹*18,000**\n🔄 *Exchange Benefits* up to ₹*25,000**\n🎁 *Da Milano Gift Set* worth ₹10,999 at just ₹*499**\n📆 Up to *36-Month No-Cost EMI**\n🛡️ *3-Yr Warranty + 3-Yr ADP + 3-Yr Antivirus* starting at just ₹*1,999**\n🤖 *Subscription to 6 AI platforms* at just ₹*999**\n🎒 *HyperX Knight Backpack* at just ₹*999**\n🎧 *HyperX Stinger 2 Headset* at just ₹*499**\n🕹️ *Steam Wallet* worth ₹2,000 at just ₹*999**\n\n⏳ *Final call for festive savings*!\n \nVisit your nearest 📍 *HP World Store TODAY* or call 📞 8657568677!\nT&C Apply",
