          {
            "id": "120363403697887235@g.us",
            "name": "IITB Group for Connecting",
            "isGroup": true,
            "kind": "group",
            "unreadCount": 0,
            "timestamp": 1793515219,
            "lastMessage": "I spent months building a startup. Now, someone else might get the opportunity to take it further.\n\nI'm opening up PropMatik for acquisition.\n\nWhat started as an idea to simplify India's real estate market became an actual technology product — with a live website, working platform, backend infrastructure and AI-powered capabilities.\n\nNow, I'm exploring the possibility of passing it on to someone who can take it to the next level.\n\nHere's what's available:\n\n🏷️ Option 1 – Domain Only\n\n- propmatik.in\n- Brandable identity for a real estate or PropTech business.\n\n💻 Option 2 – Complete Digital Product\n\n- Live PropMatik website\n- Frontend and backend source code\n- Existing product architecture\n- AI-powered features\n- Brand identity and associated digital assets\n\n🏢 Option 3 – Complete Business Acquisition\n\n- PropMatik Private Limited\n- Brand, domain and technology platform\n- Company acquisition through a mutually agreed and legally compliant transaction.\n\nI'm not just selling a domain or a website. I'm offering an opportunity to acquire an already-built starting point in the PropTech space.\n\nWho knows? The next chapter of PropMatik could be written by you.\n\nIf you're a founder, real estate entrepreneur, developer or investor interested in acquiring any of these assets, let's connect.\n\n📩 DM me for details, a product walkthrough and commercial discussion.\n\n#StartupAcquisition #PropTech #Founders #RealEstate #BusinessOpportunity",
