            "lastMessage": "*[ LAST 2 SEATS LEFT  ]*\n\nWe've kept the *last 2 spots specially for our Community Members.* \n\nBefore everyone heads off for the Diwali break, this is your chance to meet the community in person, network and learn together.\n\n*✅ Complete your registration now:* https://payments.cashfree.com/forms/ps-meetup\n\nIt'll be a small room of founders, CPOs and Product Leaders sharing what's actually changing in PM with AI, what's working, what isn't, and how they're adapting.\n\n*Why should you join us?*\n\n1. Hands-on Workshop: Build AI Agents in 60 mins.\n2. Direct Q&A: Get your questions answered by the experts.\n3. Networking & Group Challenge: Meet people who can shape your career.\n\nSeats are limited, and we're keeping a small, nominal fee, just so the room is filled with people who genuinely want to show up and participate.\n\nWould be great to see you there 💙",
