            "unreadCount": 1,
            "timestamp": 1793345554,
            "lastMessage": "*🎁 Free Certification Course: Claude Code for Product Managers*\n\nMost PMs skip Claude Code because they think it’s a developer tool, but it’s really how you turn ideas into working prototypes and data into insights, in minutes. \n\nThat's exactly why we created a completely *FREE Certification Course: Claude Code for Product Managers 🚀*\n\nTo get it, Like & Comment on this LinkedIn post: https://lnkd.in/p/gKwf4JVV\n\n𝗪𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗬𝗼𝘂’𝗹𝗹 𝗚𝗲𝘁:\n\n1. What Claude Code actually is (explained without jargon).\n2. Setting it up from scratch, even if you’ve never opened a terminal.\n3. Writing prompts that turn a PRD into a clickable prototype.\n4. Analyzing user data, feedback and CSVs in minutes.\n5. Building internal tools, dashboards and automations for your team.\n\nIf you’re a PM, aspiring PM, or switching into product this year, this will put you ahead of 90% of PMs still waiting on engineering for every small experiment. \n\nKeep Building & Keep Growing 💙",
